struct sockaddr_in

© sin_family : Address family, AF_INET for IPv4 Protocol

© sin_addr.s_addr: Source address, INADDR-_ANY to choose the local
address

© sin port: The port number

© We need to use htons() functian to convert the port number from
host byte order to network byte order.

struct sockaddr_in serveraddr;

int port = 3028;

serveraddr.sin_family = AF_INET;
serveraddr.sin_addr.s_addr = INADDR_ANY;
serveraddr.sin_port = htons(port) ;

‘Sandip Chakraborty (IIT Kharagpur) NPTEL

